visual data."},{"w":0.59381444295247399,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.33998825615887296,"t":"28 Angelina Hawley-Dolan's findings indicate that people","c":1,"x":0.045360819643874305},{"t":"mostly favour works of art which they know well.","h":0.017615971814445186,"y":0.36758661208421028,"x":0.14639174579467826,"w":0.48659795125325522,"c":1},{"t":"B","h":0.013081395479068947,"x":0.096907216236084087,"y":0.3880813951529074,"w":0.018556701342264809,"c":1},{"t":"C","w":0.016494844754536941,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1,"x":0.096907216694896478,"y":0.40697674401191897},{"y":0.42587209275787474,"h":0.011627907341393184,"c":1,"x":0.098969072350272025,"t":"D","w":0.016494844754536941},{"x":0.14432988919975293,"w":0.54845362345377602,"t":"hold fixed ideas about what makes a good work of art.","y":0.38808139551505194,"h":0.015988371754420694,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.018880298679461616,"x":0.14425644253138814,"w":0.60219787597656249,"t":"are often misled by their initial expectations of a work of art.","y":0.40477469204299887},{"w":0.60824742635091145,"c":1,"t":"have the ability to perceive the intention behind works of art.","x":0.14432989498406196,"y":0.42441860437378276,"h":0.017448688491400244},{"c":1,"t":"29 Results of studies involving Robert Pepperell's pieces suggest that people","w":0.79587626139322909,"y":0.45203488378941681,"h":0.017441859892096456,"x":0.047422694354931801},{"h":0.017441859892096456,"y":0.48110465143767267,"c":1,"x":0.1463917498469435,"w":0.55463918050130201,"t":"can appreciate a painting without fully understanding it."},{"c":1,"x":0.14226803165877555,"y":0.49999999972206377,"t":"find it satisfying to work out what a painting represents.","w":0.55670104980468749,"h":0.017441861012089777},{"c":1,"w":0.014432989756266279,"x":0.098969072029083352,"y":0.52034883694392131,"t":"C","h":0.011627907341393184},{"w":0.55463918050130212,"h":0.017615971814445075,"c":1,"x":0.14226803541945207,"y":0.51732237240931889,"t":"vary widely in the time they spend looking at paintings."},{"x":0.14432989344916181,"w":0.51546391805013025,"h":0.017441859892096456,"t":"generally prefer representational art to abstract art.","y":0.5363372093708122,"c":1},{"x":0.045360825032443014,"w":0.026804122924804691,"c":1,"y":0.56686046500085008,"t":"30","h":0.013081395479068947},{"w":0.76288660685221366,"c":1,"t":"What do the experiments described in the fifth paragraph suggest about the","x":0.094845356294980449,"h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.56540697691058039},{"w":0.23092783610026041,"t":"paintings of Mondrian?","h":0.01614797416324143,"x":0.094845360208747231,"c":1,"y":0.58426306493660352},{"h":0.019208193525313222,"c":1,"w":0.55278121948242187,"x":0.14422218503669806,"y":0.61188386558121932,"t":"They are more carefully put together than they appear."},{"x":0.096907216680168939,"t":"B","c":1,"h":0.013081395479069058,"y":0.63226744170191074,"w":0.016494844754536941},{"t":"They can be interpreted in a number of different ways.","y":0.63081395321067235,"h":0.017453809660879616,"x":0.142268052117628,"c":1,"w":0.55051544189453128},{"t":"They challenge our assumptions about shape and colour.","h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.64970930249167225,"c":1,"x":0.13608246414602321,"w":0.58762888590494788},{"c":1,"y":0.66860465096686095,"x":0.09690721667427793,"w":0.016494844754536941,"h":0.013081395479069058,"t":"D"},{"x":0.14226804066341286,"h":0.017615971814445075,"t":"They are easier to appreciate than many other abstract works.","c":1,"w":0.63092783610026038,"y":0.66705813250418611},{"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.95429938006830894,"w":0.29150957743326822,"x":0.35215268374412689,"h":0.022623461971406189,"c":1},{"w":0.026804122924804719,"x":0.91340206213553587,"c":1,"h":0.01453488361674482,"t":"51","y":0.95494186044453466}],"w":2400}